    "description": {
      "value": "<p>While in a Wild Shape form, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Lunar Radiance.</strong> Each of your attacks in a Wild Shape form can deal its normal damage type or Radiant damage. You make this choice each time you hit with those attacks.</p><p><strong>Increased Toughness.</strong> You can add your Wisdom modifier to your Constitution saving throws.</p><section id=\"secret-5SxAo2RPwoSrFTGC\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes an Active Effect which automates the bonus to Constitution saving throws.</p></section>",
